msgstr "SSH-agenten signerade och verifierade data med denna nyckel."

msgid "The YubiKey operation stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "YubiKey-operationen stoppades oväntat."

msgid "The credential will be created only on this exact device"
msgstr "Credentialen skapas endast på just den här enheten"

msgid ""
"The deletion command finished, but the selected YubiKey could not be "
"inspected afterward: {0}\n"
"The credential may or may not have been deleted. Do not retry. Reconnect and "
"inspect the YubiKey first."
msgstr ""
"Borttagningskommandot slutfördes, men den valda YubiKey:n kunde inte "
"inspekteras efteråt: {0}\n"
"Legitimeringen kan ha tagits bort eller inte. Försök inte igen. Anslut om "
"och inspektera YubiKey:n först."

msgid "The enrollment task failed."
msgstr "Registreringsuppgiften misslyckades."

msgid ""
"The exact resident credential is no longer present on the selected YubiKey. "
"Local .pub or key-handle files and any SSH-agent entry were not removed."
msgstr ""
"De exakta boende legitimationsuppgifterna finns inte längre på den valda "
"YubiKey:n. Lokala .pub-filer eller nyckelhanteringsfiler och eventuella SSH-"
"agent-poster togs inte bort."

msgid ""
"The inspected resident SSH credentials are already available in this agent."
msgstr ""
"Den inspicerade resident-SSH-credentialen finns redan tillgänglig i denna "
"agent."

