"Den icke-exporterbara privata nyckeln skyddas fortfarande av den valda "
"YubiKey.\n"
"\n"
"Algorithm: {0}\n"
"Application: {1}\n"
"Resident username: {2}\n"
"Fingerprint: {3}\n"
"\n"
"Local key handle: {4}\n"
"Public key: {5}\n"
"\n"
